Maintainer: xudo contributors <noreply@xudo.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: sudo, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~)
Recommends: systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/YaminT/xudo
Description: allowlisted privileged commands for AI coding agents (beta)
 xudo runs an allowlisted set of privileged actions through sudo or doas,
 with a root-owned rule set and a compiled-in deny-list. This beta ships
 the password path only: every invocation prompts. Not externally audited.
